  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Self-FEXT cancellation (vectoring) for use with VDSL2 transceivers</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Self-FEXT cancellation (vectoring) for use with VDSL2 transceivers</title>
